  "solution": "**Logic : Square of (Second number - 2) + 1 = First number**\n\nSo,\n\n \n• 50 : 9\n\n(9 - 2)² + 1 = 50\n\n(7)² + 1 = 50\n\n49 + 1 = 50\n\n50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• 82 : 11\n\n(11 - 2)² + 1 = 82\n\n(9)² + 1 = 82\n\n81 + 1 = 82\n\n82 = 82 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n \n• ? : 14\n\n(14 - 2)² + 1 = ?\n\n(12)² + 1 = ?\n\n144 + 1 = ?\n\n**? = 145**\n\nHence, **\"145\"** is the correct answer.",
